# Xan'tish's snakes in Orgrimmar.
# Sources: items.json / npcs.json (vendor, three snakes; the new Jungle Boa);
# the world database (his walking path, Classic data); Forever's client data
# (ItemSparse prices; every pet item teaches its companion when used).

step Xan'tish
  tip Xan'tish, the snake vendor, walks with his three snakes: from the Valley of Spirits north along the city's west side to the battleground emissaries and back. The waypoint is where his walk starts; if he is not there, follow the road north. He sells four snakes (50s each); the Jungle Boa is new in Forever. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards.
  vendor 8404                         -- Xan'tish
  buy 10360 npc 8404 optional         -- Black Kingsnake, 50s
  buy 10361 npc 8404 optional         -- Brown Snake, 50s
  buy 10392 npc 8404 optional         -- Crimson Snake, 50s
  buy 280703 "Jungle Boa" npc 8404 optional -- 50s
